{"name":"Bossa Nova","hex":"#4c3d4e","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"bossa nova","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A lively Brazilian dance that is similar to the samba.","The music of that dance.\nA genre of music originating from Brazil, similar to a fusion of jazz and samba music, no longer closely associated with the Brazilian dance."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/bossa_nova"}],"entries":[{"title":"Bossa nova","blocks":[{"text":"Bossa nova is a relaxed style of samba developed in the late 1950s and early 1960s in Rio de Janeiro, Brazil. It is mainly characterized by a calm syncopated rhythm with chords and fingerstyle mimicking the beat of a samba groove, as if it were a simplification and stylization on the guitar of the rhythm produced by a samba school band. Another defining characteristic of the style is the use of unconventional chords in some cases with complex progressions and \"ambiguous\" harmonies. A common misconception is that these complex chords and harmonies were derived from jazz, but samba guitar players have been using similar arrangement structures since the early 1920s, indicating a case of parallel evolution of styles rather than a simple transference from jazz to bossa nova. Nevertheless, bossa nova was influenced by jazz, both in the harmonies used and also by the instrumentation of songs, and today many bossa nova songs are considered jazz standards. The popularity of bossa nova has helped to renew samba and contributed to the modernization of Brazilian music in general."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif/lossy-page1-330px-Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bossa_nova","wikidata":"Q486263"},{"title":"Bossa Nova (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Bossa Nova is a 2000 Brazilian-American romantic comedy film directed by Bruno Barreto. It deals with several interwoven stories about people finding and losing love in Rio de Janeiro. It stars Amy Irving as an English language teacher named Mary Ann."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/1/13/Bossa-nova-poster02.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bossa_Nova_(film)","wikidata":"Q84022"},{"title":"Nova","blocks":[{"text":"A nova is a transient astronomical event that causes the sudden appearance of a bright, apparently \"new\" star that slowly fades over weeks or months. All observed novae involve white dwarfs in close binary systems, but causes of the dramatic appearance of a nova vary, depending on the circumstances of the two progenitor stars. The main sub-classes of novae are classical novae, recurrent novae (RNe), and dwarf novae. They are all considered to be cataclysmic variable stars."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/Making_a_Nova.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nova","wikidata":"Q6458"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif/lossy-page1-500px-Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif/lossy-page1-1280px-Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/86/Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif/lossy-page1-500px-Baden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABaden_Powell_no_Teatro_da_Praia%2C_1972.tif"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Bossa_nova_dance_pattern.png/500px-Bossa_nova_dance_pattern.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Bossa_nova_dance_pattern.png/1280px-Bossa_nova_dance_pattern.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Bossa_nova_dance_pattern.png/500px-Bossa_nova_dance_pattern.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Bossa nova rhythm[8]","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABossa_nova_dance_pattern.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Jarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg/500px-Jarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Jarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg/1280px-Jarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/75/Jarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg/500px-Jarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Jarkko Toivonen performing in 1993","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AJarkko_Toivonen_Jumo_Jazz_Club_1993.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Basic_bossa_nova_guitar_rhythm.PNG/330px-Basic_bossa_nova_guitar_rhythm.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/93/Basic_bossa_nova_guitar_rhythm.PNG/330px-Basic_bossa_nova_guitar_rhythm.PNG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A basic bossa nova guitar rhythm for a C major chord. Note the syncopation in the chord's rhythm and the sixth and ninth added to the C major for a richer sound.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABasic_bossa_nova_guitar_rhythm.PNG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Nova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg/500px-Nova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Nova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg/1280px-Nova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/50/Nova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg/500px-Nova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Nova Eridani 2009 (apparent magnitude ~8.4)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ANova-Eridani-2009-LB4.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/GKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg/500px-GKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/GKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg/1280px-GKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/GKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg/500px-GKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"GK Persei: Nova of 1901","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGKPersei-MiniSuperNova-20150316.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Nova_in_M31.jpg/330px-Nova_in_M31.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/db/Nova_in_M31.jpg/330px-Nova_in_M31.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=pa